---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import QuizRunner from '../../components/quiz/QuizRunner.astro';
import StructuredData from '../../components/StructuredData.astro';
import {dragonTypeQuiz} from '../../lib/quizzes';
const quiz=dragonTypeQuiz;
const steps=[{name:'Begin the quiz',text:'Select Start the quiz to begin twelve original questions.'},{name:'Choose twelve answers',text:'Select one option per question. Each answer advances automatically.'},{name:'Read and copy your result',text:'Read your fan-made match and select Share as text to copy it.'}];
---
<BaseLayout title="Which Dragon Would Choose You? — Fourth Wing Dragon Quiz" description="Answer twelve original questions to find a fan-made dragon color profile. See the scoring dimensions, tie rules and shareable result." breadcrumbs={[{name:"Dragon Quiz",href:'/quiz/dragon-type/'}]}>
<h1>Which Dragon Would Choose You? (Fourth Wing Quiz)</h1><p class="lead">A fan-made personality journey, with seven color results. These interpretations are not canon.</p><QuizRunner quiz={quiz}/>
<section class="prose"><h2>How the scoring works</h2><p>This quiz uses twelve questions about preferences and everyday decisions. Every question offers four choices, labeled internally with the stable identifiers a, b, c and d. Choosing an answer adds its assigned weight to one of seven dimensions: valor, loyalty, cunning, ambition, resolve, insight and shadow. The wording and weights are original to this site. They are a transparent design for an entertainment activity, rather than a psychological instrument or a hidden rule from the novels.</p><p>All seven dimensions begin at zero. Each selected option currently contributes three points to its associated dimension. Your result is the profile attached to the largest accumulated score. If several dimensions finish with the same score, the first matching result in this quiz’s published result order wins. There is no random tie breaker. Repeating the same sequence of choices therefore produces the same result. Unanswered, extra or invalid choices do not produce a result.</p><h2>Reading your result</h2><p>The result order is displayed below so you can understand how ties are resolved. The descriptive paragraphs and trait tags are creative interpretations of your choices. A color label does not mean every dragon of that color behaves the same way. An ability label does not explain how a signet awakens, who can receive it, or which character possesses it. Neither quiz assigns a rider or predicts an event in the story.</p><p>During play, selecting an option moves straight to the next question. The progress label shows your current position out of twelve, while the URL records the current step. The URL contains no answers and does not restore a completed session after reloading. Restart clears the choices in memory. The activity sends no quiz answers to a server, uses no account, and saves no profile.</p><p>At the end, use Share as text to copy your result to your own clipboard. Nothing is posted automatically. You can then compare the reference matrix, explore the other quiz, or begin again with different choices. Treat the result as a creative conversation starter and keep it separate from sourced information about the books.</p></section>
<section class="prose"><h2>Result order and dimensions</h2><ol>{quiz.results.map(r=><li><strong>{r.title}</strong> — {r.dimension}: {r.traits.join(', ')}.</li>)}</ol><h2>Three steps</h2><ol>{steps.map(s=><li><strong>{s.name}.</strong> {s.text}</li>)}</ol><p>Continue with <a href="/quiz/signet/">the signet quiz</a>, the <a href="/dragons/">dragon reference matrix</a>, or our <a href="/guides/threshing/">Threshing reading guide</a>.</p></section>
<StructuredData data={{'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'HowTo',name:"How to take the dragon quiz",step:steps.map((s,i)=>({'@type':'HowToStep',position:i+1,name:s.name,text:s.text}))}}/>
<StructuredData data={{'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'Quiz',name:'Which Dragon Would Choose You? (Fourth Wing Quiz)',description:'A fan-made personality quiz with twelve original questions and seven color results.',about:{'@type':'Thing',name:'Fourth Wing dragon quiz'}}}/>
</BaseLayout>
